  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Reading the white Digital Shade Gu in the Gu Yue clan’s secret room, Fang Yuan finds only three rank three recipes worth using on the basis of Moonglow Gu, and this is the third of them. Unlike the other two, Illusory Moon Gu is not used to attack: once activated it lets the Gu Master create a shadow clone that attracts attacks and confuses the enemy. Once refined, it can be used as the basis for the rank four Moonshadow Gu. Its refinement recipe, like the other two built on Moonglow Gu, consumes large amounts of moon orchid flower petals.",
        "chapters": [
          156
        ],
